Kafka

Kafka is a distributed event streaming platform used to send, store, and process messages/events between applications.

Suppose mana application lo Order placed ayyindi.

Order service ki order vachindi:

Order #101
Customer: Ravi
Amount: ₹5000

Now mana system lo different services ki ee information kavali:

Order Service
      |
      ↓
"Order #101 placed"
      |
      ├──→ Payment Service
      |
      ├──→ Notification Service
      |
      └──→ Inventory Service

Instead of Order Service directly calling all three services:

Order → Payment
Order → Notification
Order → Inventory

Kafka ni middle lo use cheyyachu:

                 Kafka
                  |
        "Order #101 placed"
          /        |        \
         ↓         ↓         ↓
     Payment   Notification  Inventory

Kafka acts like a middleman/message platform.

