17. Why do companies use Kafka?
1. Asynchronous communication

Producer message send chesi continue avvachu.

Producer → Kafka
            ↓
         Consumer

Consumer later process cheyyachu.

2. Loose coupling

Services direct ga depend avvakunda Kafka through communicate chestayi.

Service A → Kafka ← Service B
3. Scalability

Partitions + multiple consumers use chesi workload distribute cheyyachu.

4. Fault tolerance

Kafka messages persist chestundi and replication use cheyyachu.So broker failure scenarios lo data loss ni reduce cheyyadaniki Kafka replication provide chestundi.

5. High throughput

Kafka huge number of messages/events handle cheyyadaniki designed.

